 198:     "stroke, serious bleeding or cardiac arrest. EAST-AFNET 4 counts cardiovascular "
 199:     "death, stroke, and hospitalisation for worsening heart failure or acute "
 200:     "coronary syndrome. RAFT-AF counts all-cause mortality and heart failure "
 201:     "events, where an event includes an outpatient intravenous diuretic visit. NO "
 202:     "TWO OF THE FOUR ARE THE SAME. An average over them is an average over four "
 203:     "questions.")
 204: 
 205: WITHDRAWN_NOTE_CORRECTION = (
 206:     "THE EARLIER WITHDRAWAL REASON WAS WRONG, AND IT WAS WRONG IN THE DIRECTION "
 207:     "THAT MATTERS. It said '3 of 4 contributing trials carry no outcome "
 208:     "definition'. All four DO carry one; they are on the registry and they were "
 209:     "not read. Absence of evidence was recorded where there was evidence of "
 210:     "difference. The verdict does not change -- the pool was not established and "
 211:     "is not established now -- but the ground under it does, and a withdrawal "
 212:     "needs the same evidentiary standard as a claim. This correction was found by "
 213:     "reading the four registry records, which is the step that should have "
 214:     "preceded the withdrawal rather than following it.")
