 325:                "on their own terms: RAFT-AF's event counts were 44 and 55 against a "
 326:                "true 50 and 64, and EAST-AFNET 4's arm labels were swapped so the "
 327:                "page named USUAL CARE as the intervention arm.",
 328:         "for_a_reader_who_wrote_the_old_numbers_down": "None of the four old values "
